### Extensión "REST Client" de VS Code → pulsa "Send Request"
@base = http://localhost:3000/api
@key = API_KEY=hola123

############ ENTRIES ############

### Todas las entries (con datos del autor)
GET {{base}}/entries

### Entries de un autor
GET {{base}}/entries?email=alejandru@thebridgeschool.es

### Crear entry → 201
POST {{base}}/entries?{{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "noticia desde Node",
  "content": "va a triunfar esto2",
  "email": "alejandru@thebridgeschool.es",
  "category": "sucesos"
}

### Crear la MISMA entry otra vez → 409 (título UNIQUE)
POST {{base}}/entries?{{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "noticia desde Node",
  "content": "repetida",
  "email": "alejandru@thebridgeschool.es",
  "category": "sucesos"
}

### Modificar entry → 200
PUT {{base}}/entries?{{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "noticia desde Node",
  "new_title": "noticia desde Node editada",
  "content": "contenido nuevo",
  "email": "birja@thebridgeschool.es",
  "category": "Software"
}

### Borrar entry → 200
DELETE {{base}}/entries?{{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "noticia desde Node editada" }

############ AUTHORS ############

### Todos los autores
GET {{base}}/authors

### Un autor
GET {{base}}/authors?email=alejandru@thebridgeschool.es

### Crear autor → 201
POST {{base}}/authors?{{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pepe",
  "surname": "Pruebas",
  "email": "pepe@thebridgeschool.es",
  "image": "https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/thumb/men/1.jpg"
}

### Actualizar autor (y cambiar su email con new_email) → 200
PUT {{base}}/authors?{{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pepe",
  "surname": "Editado",
  "email": "pepe@thebridgeschool.es",
  "image": "https://randomuser.me/api/portraits/thumb/men/2.jpg"
}

### Borrar autor → 200
DELETE {{base}}/authors?{{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "pepe@thebridgeschool.es" }

### Borrar autor con entries → 200 (se borran también sus entries)
DELETE {{base}}/authors?{{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "birja@thebridgeschool.es" }

############ VALIDACIONES (express-validator) → todas deben dar 400 ############

### Email mal escrito en el query
GET {{base}}/entries?email=no-es-un-email

### Entry sin datos → lista de errores
POST {{base}}/entries?{{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Category de más de 15 caracteres
POST {{base}}/entries?{{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Prueba validación",
  "content": "contenido",
  "email": "alejandru@thebridgeschool.es",
  "category": "categoriademasiadolarga"
}

### Autor con image que no es URL y email inválido
POST {{base}}/authors?{{key}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pepe",
  "surname": "Pruebas",
  "email": "pepe-sin-arroba",
  "image": "foto"
}

############ API_KEY → 401 ############

### Sin API_KEY
POST {{base}}/entries
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### API_KEY errónea
POST {{base}}/entries?API_KEY=mal
Content-Type: application/json

{}
